English Summary (for reference only — 中文正文为准)
================================================================

All content in this repository — motion templates, embeddable components,
prompts, and sample renders — is free to copy, modify, and use in
personal or commercial projects; anything you generate with it is
yours, no attribution or fee required. There is no paid tier and no
membership restriction on this repository.

You may NOT: sell or redistribute the repository content itself
(including in paid courses, communities, or prompt-aggregation sites);
share or publicly upload member-delivered content (production Skills,
pipeline tools); remove embedded tracking marks; or use the author's
brand ("老马AI研习社") for promotion without written permission.
Member-delivered content is licensed per-person with embedded
fingerprints; leaks are traceable and may result in termination and
civil claims.

Third-party assets (GSAP, lottie-web, sample audio, fonts, hyperframes)
are governed by their own licenses — see NOTICE.md. Font files (MiSans,
MEBHeiHeiTi) are not redistributed in this repository; templates fall
back to system font stacks.

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind; liability limited to
the maximum extent permitted by law. Commercial licensing beyond this
scope: contact the author via the channels listed above.
